Local build instructions
========================
Prerequisites: make and a C compiler named cc (instructor-provided).
This project includes a Makefile; it does NOT provide configure.
Run: make
Run: ./hello
Run make again; it should be up to date.
Then run sleep 1; touch hello.c; make and observe the rebuild.
No install target is provided. Do not use sudo.
If the toolchain is unavailable, analyze ../samples/build.txt instead.
